      "day": 0,
      "dayMask": 0,
      "description": "<p>Every third Wednesday from April through October, our downtown shops are staying open a little later and making the night feel like something more. Expect small surprises, special offerings, and a reason to wander from one door to the next.<br>This is your invitation to slow down, shop local, and be part of what\u2019s happening right here. Pop into your favorite spots, discover somewhere new, and run into people you know (or want to).<br>It\u2019s not just about shopping. It\u2019s about showing up for your community, keeping our downtown vibrant, and making a midweek night feel like something worth stepping out for.<br>Third Wednesdays. Downtown. See you out there.</p>",
